A||N||6||FieroJoe||Quick OEM wheel Question||||1||
Z||000000||FieroJoe||02-21-2001||10:29 PM||||ok, I know that there is a difference between GT wheels and Formula wheels, but I cannot remember what it was.  Was one of them a different size, color?  And, while on this topic, was black, gold, and silver all oem colors for spoke Fiero rims?<P>Thanks!<P>------------------<BR>FieroJoe<BR>c311t@yahoo.com<BR>AIM: Fiero87311, Snowboarder0311<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Indyellowgt||02-21-2001||10:38 PM||||Fierojoe!Hello!<BR>The 88GT/Formula front wheels were 15x6 and the rears were 15x7's.<BR>The 86-7 GT wheels were all 15x7's,in the gray/silver lace only.<BR>88 you had the option of the black or gold wheels.GM canned the silver/gray color in 88.<P>Hope this helps!!!<P><BR>P.S. new member,Mark Webber!!!||||reg||3
Z||000002||danny boy||02-21-2001||11:27 PM|||| the off set on the front wheels for '88 was different also<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stealth_feb2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||mrfiero||02-22-2001||12:22 AM||||Gold wheels were only available on the '88 GT......all Formulas (and most GT's) came with black ones.||||reg||1
Z||000004||FieroJoe||02-22-2001||10:29 AM||||Welcome to the Forum Indyellowgt!<P>Thanks for the info, I had always wondered the difference.  Personally, I like my stock polished, but if I ever decide to upgrade, I now know what there is.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/005246.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/005246.html</A> ||||reg||14
Z||000005||tgowens||02-22-2001||12:15 PM||||all of that info is correct.....gold on the '88GT only, Black on the Formula.......the offset on the front was 35mm and on the rear 42mm..........all other years (with the diamond spoke lace wheels) were silver(gray) with a 42mm offset all the way around......||||reg||1
Z||000006||skitime||02-22-2001||03:16 PM||||Does anyone know the color code for the gold wheels?  Nobody seems to know which gold to use.||||reg||1
